    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.mp4?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MOUSE: P.I. For Hire</strong> is a gritty, noir-fueled first-person shooter that draws inspiration from the classic cartoons of the 1930s. The monochromatic visual style of hand-drawn rubber hose animation and retro jazz soundtrack are created with the same techniques of the era. As Private Investigator Jack Pepper, you will discover that a corrupt city full of crooks and danger is just a taste of things to come; explore the noir-inspired city teeming with heavily armed gangs, mobs and characters from the darkside to uncover the secrets within Mouseburg. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/1f7b6192993877279decfdc1f8630187.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/1f7b6192993877279decfdc1f8630187.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Private Investigator Jack Pepper, once a war hero, now a detective in a world where danger lurks in the smallest mouse hole. His journey starts with a seemingly clich\u00e9 damsel in distress, but as P.I. Pepper begins to scratch the surface of Mouseburg\u2019s seedy underbelly, his journey for justice quickly spirals into a complex web of intrigue, involving murder, corruption, and the unlikeliest of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2017efb78fb45637afadd5ff80306ac4.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2017efb78fb45637afadd5ff80306ac4.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From crackling tommy guns to explosive firepower, each tool in Pepper\u2019s arsenal is designed to bring out the noir grit and cartoon chaos using an array of classic yet creatively twisted weaponry in epic fights and boss battles with comical demises. Encounter a mischievous and disturbed cast of big bads as Pepper takes the gritty journey to the dark side of town. Playful weaponry and a distinctive health display, coupled with enemies behaving like cartoon characters, add a lighthearted twist to traditional FPS gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2548165adac842c44c18a30a8080b30b.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2548165adac842c44c18a30a8080b30b.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse city playground, from the dark city streets of Mouseburg, to a noir film studio and casinos, to the Marina port and dock district, vast underground sewers and swamp marshlands. Beware what lurks beneath the surface! Loot collectibles and clues, play mini-games and fight through the city\u2019s towns, alleyways and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/a95a95f65a2e53f36d12af93b3ad43d8.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/a95a95f65a2e53f36d12af93b3ad43d8.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and combine powerful upgrades with comical weapons to knock-down, slash, stomp and blow apart enemies in creative and violent ways, as Pepper ventures through non-linear maps trying to thwart the takeover by corrupt politicians. Enhance melee combat with a can of Spike-D Spinach, extend aerial traversal with a Helicopter, or even attach your mouse tail to a Grappling Hook to rapidly ascend across platforms and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/5402513a5b7c0e53eeeca5398e7576e7.mp4?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MOUSE: P.I. For Hire</strong> is a gritty, noir-fueled first-person shooter that draws inspiration from the classic cartoons of the 1930s. The monochromatic visual style of hand-drawn rubber hose animation and retro jazz soundtrack are created with the same techniques of the era. As Private Investigator Jack Pepper, you will discover that a corrupt city full of crooks and danger is just a taste of things to come; explore the noir-inspired city teeming with heavily armed gangs, mobs and characters from the darkside to uncover the secrets within Mouseburg. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/1f7b6192993877279decfdc1f8630187.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/1f7b6192993877279decfdc1f8630187.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Private Investigator Jack Pepper, once a war hero, now a detective in a world where danger lurks in the smallest mouse hole. His journey starts with a seemingly clich\u00e9 damsel in distress, but as P.I. Pepper begins to scratch the surface of Mouseburg\u2019s seedy underbelly, his journey for justice quickly spirals into a complex web of intrigue, involving murder, corruption, and the unlikeliest of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2017efb78fb45637afadd5ff80306ac4.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2017efb78fb45637afadd5ff80306ac4.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From crackling tommy guns to explosive firepower, each tool in Pepper\u2019s arsenal is designed to bring out the noir grit and cartoon chaos using an array of classic yet creatively twisted weaponry in epic fights and boss battles with comical demises. Encounter a mischievous and disturbed cast of big bads as Pepper takes the gritty journey to the dark side of town. Playful weaponry and a distinctive health display, coupled with enemies behaving like cartoon characters, add a lighthearted twist to traditional FPS gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2548165adac842c44c18a30a8080b30b.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/2548165adac842c44c18a30a8080b30b.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse city playground, from the dark city streets of Mouseburg, to a noir film studio and casinos, to the Marina port and dock district, vast underground sewers and swamp marshlands. Beware what lurks beneath the surface! Loot collectibles and clues, play mini-games and fight through the city\u2019s towns, alleyways and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/a95a95f65a2e53f36d12af93b3ad43d8.poster.avif?t=1749712017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416450/extras/a95a95f65a2e53f36d12af93b3ad43d8.webm?t=1749712017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and combine powerful upgrades with comical weapons to knock-down, slash, stomp and blow apart enemies in creative and violent ways, as Pepper ventures through non-linear maps trying to thwart the takeover by corrupt politicians. Enhance melee combat with a can of Spike-D Spinach, extend aerial traversal with a Helicopter, or even attach your mouse tail to a Grappling Hook to rapidly ascend across platforms and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Join private investigator Jack Pepper on a guns blazing, jazz-fueled adventure in MOUSE: P.I. For Hire. MOUSE combines the charm of hand-drawn rubber hose animation inspired by the classic cartoons of the 1930\u2019s with the adrenaline and action of an explosive first person shooter.",
